.* JOB2: the task menu for more job tasks.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='JOB2'.
:IMPORT NAME=CHGGRPA PNLGRP=QHWCCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=CHGJOB PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=DSPJOBLOG PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=ENDGRPJOB PNLGRP=QHWCCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=TFRGRPJOB PNLGRP=QHWCCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKJOBSCDE PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKSBMJOB PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=JOB2 HELP=HLPJOB2 KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Jobs
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD DSPJOBLOG' HELP=DSPJOBLOG.Display your job log
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?CHGJOB' HELP=CHGJOB.Change your job
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?SBMDBJOB' HELP='JOB2/OPT3'.Submit a job to batch from a source file
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD WRKSBMJOB' HELP=WRKSBMJOB.Work with your batch jobs
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD ?CHGGRPA' HELP=CHGGRPA.Change your group job attributes
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD ?TFRGRPJOB' HELP=TFRGRPJOB.Transfer to a group job
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD ?ENDGRPJOB' HELP=ENDGRPJOB.End a group job
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD WRKJOBSCDE' HELP=WRKJOBSCDE.Work with job schedule entries
:MENUI OPTION=70 ACTION='MENU CMDJOB' HELP='JOB2/OPT70'.Related commands
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPJOB2.Jobs - Help
:P.The second page of job tasks: your own job, group jobs and the job
schedule.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F13=Information Assistant
:PD.Shows menu INFO.
:PT.F16=System Main menu
:PD.Shows menu MAIN.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='JOB2/OPT3'.Submit a job to batch from a source file
:P.Option 3. Runs the SBMDBJOB command&colon. Submit a job to batch from
a source file.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='JOB2/OPT70'.Related commands
:P.Option 70. Shows menu CMDJOB&colon. Related commands.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
